meta {
  name: Library
  seq: 26
}

docs {
  A read-only gallery of the files that passed through agent chats and
  the workflow builder — what members uploaded and what agents made.
  Separate from `Artifacts` (which owns uploading, sharing and versions);
  both read the same stored files.

  `Library - List` stores the first item's id as `libraryArtifactId`.
}
